{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "1", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "(απόσπασμα)"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "2", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ὁ γέρων ὁ Φιλοπαπποὺς"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "3", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τὴν Μαξιμοῦν ἐλάλει:"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "4", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "«Θωρεῖς αὐτὸν τὸν ἄγουρον"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "5", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ποὺ στέκει εἰς τὸ λιθάριν"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "6", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "κ’ ἔστησεν τὸ κοντάριν του"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "7", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ἀπάνου του ἀκουμπίζει;"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "8", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Ἐκδέχεται νὰ ὑπάγωμεν ὅλοι ἀπάνου εἰς αὖτον,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "9", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "κἂν τάχα μοναχὸς ἐστὶν ἐμᾶς οὐδὲν φοβᾶται."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "10", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Ἂν εὕρη τόπον νὰ ἐμπῆ εἰς τὸν λαόν μας μέσα,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "11", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ὥσπερ πετρίτης ἄχρωμος, ὅταν ἐμπῆ εἰς κυνήγιν,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "12", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ χύση τὸ πτερούγιν του"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "13", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ τὰ ὄρνεα ἀποκτείνη,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "14", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "οὕτως ἐμᾶς ἂν γυριστῆ, τινὰς νὰ μὴ τὸν δώση."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "15", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Ἀλλ’ ἂς προκαρτερέψωμεν"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "16", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ τότε ἂς τὸν ἰδοῦμε"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "17", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ νὰ τὸν περιφέρωμε, καὶ οὐ μὴ καβαλικεύση."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "18", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "εἰ δὲ καθίση εἰς ἄλογον, ἀπιλογίαν μᾶς κάμνει»."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "19", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Καὶ τότε ἡ κούρβα ἡ Μαξιμοῦ"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "20", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τὸν γέροντα ἀτιμάζει:"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "21", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "«Ἔβγα ἀπ’ ἐδῶ, λυσσόγερε, υἱὲ τῆς ἀπωλείας."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "22", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ὡς καὶ ἀπ’ τὰ γέρα τὰ πολλὰ"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "23", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ὁ κῶλος σου ἐτσιγκρίασε."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "24", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Ἐγὼ ἔλεγα φουσάτα ἔχει"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "25", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ἀγούρους ἀνδρειωμένους"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "26", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ἐπῆρα τὰ φουσάτα μου"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "27", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ἦλθα νὰ πολεμήσω."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "28", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Ἐγὼ μόνη καὶ μοναχὴ νὰ κατέβω εἰς αὖτον,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "29", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "νὰ κόψω τὸ κεφάλιν του καὶ ἐδῶ νὰ σᾶς τὸ φέρω,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "30", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "νὰ ἐπάρω τὸ κοράσιον καὶ ἐδῶ νὰ σᾶς τὸ φέρω"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "31", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "νὰ ἐπάρω τὴν πεθύμιαν σας"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "32", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ἐδῶ νὰ σᾶς τὴν φέρω καὶ ἐσεῖς μὴ κουρασθῆ- τε»."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "33", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Καὶ σύντομα ἐπιλάλησεν, τὸν ποταμὸν περάση,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "34", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ἐγὼ δὲ τὴν ἐλάλησα φωνὴν ἀπὸ μακρόθεν:"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "35", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "«Αὐτόθε στέκου, Μαξιμοῦ, ὧδε μηδὲν περάσης!"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "36", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Τοὺς ἄνδρας πρέπει νὰ περνοῦν,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "37", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἀμὴ ὄχι τὰς γυναῖκας."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "38", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Περάσειν ἔχω, Μαξιμοῦ, ὡς διὰ σέναν τὸ ποτάμιν"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "39", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ νὰ σοῦ ἀντιμέψωμεν,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "40", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ὡς καὶ τὸ δίκαιον ἔχεις»."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "41", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Τὸν γρίβαν μου ἐπιλάλησα, τὸν ποταμὸν περάση,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "42", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ εἶχεν νερὸν ὁ ποταμὸς"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "43", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "πολὺν καὶ βουρκωμένον καὶ ἐξέπεσεν ὁ γρίβας μου"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "44", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ἐχώθην ἕως τραχήλου."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "45", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ δένδρον ἔπεψεν ὁ Θεὸς ἀπέσω εἰς τὸ ποτάμιν"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "46", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ἂν εἶχε λείπειν τὸ δενδρόν,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "47", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἐπνίγετον ὁ Ἀκρίτης."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "48", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Καὶ ὡς εἶδεν τοῦτο ἡ Μαξιμοῦ,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "49", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἀπάνω μου ἐκατέβη."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "50", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "κοντάριν ἐμαλάκιζεν, τὴν κονταρέαν μὲ δώση"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "51", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ταῦτα τὸ κοντάριν της ἔριψα παρὰ μίαν"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "52", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ σύντομα ἔριψα ραβδίν,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "53", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τὴν Μαξιμοῦν ἐλάλουν:"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "54", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "«Ἐλεῶ τὰ κάλλη σου, κυρά,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "55", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "βλέπε μὴ κινδυνεύσης."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "56", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἀλλὰ ἂς δώσω, ,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "57", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τὴν φάραν σου ραβδέαν"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "58", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ἐκ τὴν ραβδέαν, Μαξιμοῦ,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "59", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "νόησε μὲ τίναν ἔχεις»."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "60", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Καὶ ἐγὼ ραβδέαν ἔδωσα τὴν φάραν ’ς"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "61", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τὰς κουτάλας"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "62", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ἀνάσκελα ἐξήπλωσεν ἡ θαυμαστὴ ἡ φάρα."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "63", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Καὶ τότε πάλι ἡ Μαξιμοῦ οὕτως μὲ παρεκάλει:"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "64", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "«Κύρκα, φοβήσου τὸν Θεὸν"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "65", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ἀπὲ συμπάθησέ μου"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "66", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ἂς φέρουν πάλιν ἄλογον,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "67", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "διὰ νὰ κάτσω ἀπάνω"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "68", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ νὰ νοήσης, ἄγουρε, καὶ τὴν ἐμὴν ἀνδρείαν»."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "69", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Καὶ ἐγὼ αὐτὴν παραχωρῶ ἵνα καβαλικεύση"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "70", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ἂν ἔνι ἡ γεῦσις ἔμνοστος, πάλι νὰ δευτερώση."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "71", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Τὸν Λίανδρον ἐφώνιαξεν καὶ φέρνει της ἱππάριν,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "72", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "πηδᾶ κ’ ἐκαβαλίκευσε καὶ παίρνει καὶ κοντάριν"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "73", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ἀπὸ μακρέα μ’ ἐφώναζε:"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "74", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "«Ἐδὰ σὲ βλέπω, Ἀκρίτη!»"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "75", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Καὶ τὸ κοντάρι ἐμάκρυνε,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "76", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τὴν κονταρίαν μὲ δώση."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "77", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Σπαθέαν τῆς φάρας ἔδωκα ἀπάνω"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "78", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "εἰς τὸ κεφάλιν."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "79", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τὰ δύο μέρη ἐσχίσθησαν κ’ ἔπεσαν παρὰ μίαν"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "80", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἦτον καὶ σέλα πάντερπνος,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "81", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ὅλη κατεζουλίστην,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "82", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ἀπέμεινεν ἡ Μαξιμοῦ, πεζή,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "83", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἐλεεινὴ εἰς τὸν κάμπον."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "84", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Τὸ ὑπόδημά μου ἐφίλησεν"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "85", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ οὕτως μὲ παρεκάλει:"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "86", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "«Κύρκα, φοβήσου τὸν Θεόν,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "87", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "πάλιν συμπάθησέ με εἰς τὴν μωρίαν τούτην,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "88", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ὅτι παρὰ σαλῶν"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "89", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ἄτακτων ἀνθρώπων ἐδιδάχθην"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "90", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ἐσὺ μόνος μὲ κέρδισε καὶ ἄλλος μὴ μὲ κερδίση»."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "91", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Καὶ ἐγὼ τὴν Μαξιμοῦ οὕτως ἀπιλογήθην:"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "92", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "«Μὰ τὸν Θεόν, ἡ Μαξιμοῦ, οὐκ ἔν’ τὸ ἐνθύμημά σου."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "93", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἡ κόρη τὴν ἐγὼ φιλῶ τῶν εὐγενῶν ὑπάρχει."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "94", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἔχει γὰρ πλοῦτος ἄπειρον καὶ συγγενοὺς ἐνδόξους"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "95", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ἀδέλφια πολυορεκτικὰ καὶ ἀδελφοὺς πλουσίους"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "96", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ πάντας ἐξηρνήσατο καὶ μετὰ μέναν ἦλθεν"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "97", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ὁ Θεὸς ὁ πάντων δυνατὸς αὐτὸς νὰ μᾶς χωρίση."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "98", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Εἰδὲ ἂν ὁρμῆς νὰ πορνευθῆς, ἐγὼ νὰ σοῦ τὸ ποίσω»."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "99", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Καὶ ἐπέζευσα τὸν μαῦρον μου καὶ λύω τ’ ἄρματά μου"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "100", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ τὸ ἐπεθύμα ἡ Μαξιμοῦ γοργὸν τῆς τὸ ἐποῖκα."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "101", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ἀπείτις τὸ ἔκαμα ἐγὼ τῆς Μαξιμοῦς"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "102", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τῆς κούρβας,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "103", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "εὐθὺς ἐκαβαλίκευσα καὶ ἐπῆγα εἰς τὸ κοράσιον."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "104", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Καὶ τότε τῆς βεργόλικος ἄκο τὸ τί τῆς λέγω:"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "105", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "«Εἶδες, ὀμμάτια μου καλά, τί ἀνδραγαθίας ἐποῖκα;»"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "106", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Καὶ τότε τὸ κοράσιον ἄκου τὸ τί μοῦ λέγει:"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "107", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "«Εἶδα σε, ὀμμάτια μου καλά,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "108", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τὸ φῶς τῶν ὀφθαλμῶν μου,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "109", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τὸ πῶς ἐμονομάχησες ὅλους τοὺς ἀπελάτας,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "110", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ὅταν ἐμονομάχησες τὴν Μαξιμοῦν τὴν κόρην."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "111", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ εἰς τὸ στενὸν τὸ πέραμαν,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "112", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "εἰς τὸ βαθὺν τὸ ρυάκιν,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "113", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "πολλὰ πολλὰ μοῦ ἄργησες. πιστεύω νὰ τὴν εἶχες»."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "114", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Καὶ τότε τὴν βεργόλικον οὕτως τὴν συντυχαίνω:"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "115", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "«Ὡς ἔδωσα τὸ ἱππάριν της τὴν ὕστερην ραβδέαν,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "116", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἐξέπεσεν ἡ Μαξιμοῦ ἀπὸ τὸ ἱππάριν κάτω."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "117", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἦτον καὶ σέλα πάντερπνος,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "118", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ὅλη κατεζουλίστην, καὶ πίστευσέ με, λυγερή,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "119", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ὅτι ἀληθῶς σὲ λέγω,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "120", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ὅτι πολλὰ ἐλυπήθηκα τὰ δύο της τὰ φαρία»."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "121", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Καὶ τότε τὸ κοράσιον ἐγέλασε μεγάλως,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "122", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "στρεφνὰ γλυκέα μ’ ἐπερίλαβε καὶ ἐμὲν ἐσυχνοφίλει."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "123", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ τότε τὸ κοράσιον οὕτως τὸ συντυχαίνω:"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "124", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "«Μετὰ τὸ φθείρειν Μαξιμοῦν τρία κακὰ ἔποικά την:"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "125", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "πρῶτον μὲν ὅτι εἶχα την, δεύτερον ὅτι ἐντράπη,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "126", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τρίτον καὶ περισσότερον ἐχάσεν"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "127", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "τὴν ἀνδρείαν της καὶ πομπεμένη ἀπόφευγεν"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "128", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἀπὸ τὸν Μιλιμίτσην»."}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "129", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "Καὶ ὁ Λίανδρος ὁ ταπεινός, πλήρης κατησχυμένος,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "130", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ οἱ ἑκατὸν οἱ πρόλοιποι τῆς Μαξιμοῦς οἱ ἀγοῦροι"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "131", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ὁ θαυμαστὸς ὁ Κίνναμος, ἀλλὰ καὶ ὁ κὺρ Γιαννάκης"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "132", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ἄλλοι ἀπελάτες ἑκατὸν"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "133", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ὁ Φιλοπαπποὺς ὁ γέρων"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "134", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "πάντες ἐξεσκορπίσθησαν"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "135", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "ἐκ τοῦ Ἀκρίτη τὸν φόβον,"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "136", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "νὰ μὴ τοὺς καταφθάση ἐκεῖ"}
{"urn": "cogByz.digenes_akritas_escorial", "edition": "wikisource", "locus": "137", "source": "byzantine_vernacular", "license": "Public domain / CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikisource)", "text": "καὶ ὅλους κακοδοικήση"}
